{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10011_01_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c1329ce8cfaa8a60ed1cba29bd3bd4095c405f67f380a296dc3bea3f812c4402",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d1e1079d647135a0beea0c562ffbb2737e4b94129cd78fe963d879de4c655ff",
      "text": "演出结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:badf37c1a8242a658cd251a564a3715a9018f524d80362c047993977e644bfb8",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n现场的一体感太厉害了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fbb21749f880991b14accad6fbbbbf80cb2d5a585d698db8a86b610e407f4d8",
      "text": "所以我不就说过了嘛？只要我拿出真本事，\n还能让现场更嗨呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91ca2eee5c267b821f6e0cd1b998e96a8e33184278e22cdc933d248bd82e6178",
      "text": "应该也有不少人成为我们的天使酱和天使君了\n吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14620719e207cd257f46878fa09c1ad31f012a09bcebed9b21ef0a902fc75cfa",
      "text": "喂，你们几个别太得意忘形了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d321e933897c3534828937dbb2d000f182fa0ffbbf2309468ad7e3aba3bfce69",
      "text": "你这家伙，又来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecb5be0660bead4cf1fe1a688ffe092b8adffdf115069048a93ccd21da335665",
      "text": "偶像不过是嘻嘻哈哈傻笑，\n自己既不会写曲也不会填词。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc20e584cb2f9af9a32acd3235e70147b4a7ff0d97790e4b9e5833f8f0deeca4",
      "text": "不就是一群什么都不会的丢人家伙嘛！\n啊哈哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7e7e1c83bc54f47127a943dbe47d214334f363bfe9709470e7054c0c7ff4df3",
      "text": "你眼里看不到观众吗？什么都做不到的\n家伙，怎么可能把气氛调动到那种地步啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7ec86f7a8ef59edd7e3ddc5ec21858ee92e31e51082d20f763bd62cc4f5c03a",
      "text": "我们虽然不是乐队，\n但作为偶像，已经把技术磨砺到了极致。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ba459a177e95aa2b3d7b815682fcf432bb8b4061babebfc559dfd08c63f97d8",
      "text": "这份力量是我们的骄傲，\n没有哪怕一丁点的难为情哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3583a113e1b6cbba131b1cec1d098afd9b9f4196d99f71a2b7cf6c4464232ce5",
      "text": "什……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab5c4651e2f1fb0811120b8e6e89a16b28dfa85f6ee564e12a4303e034c39bf3",
      "text": "我们可还有一次出场机会呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:642135f921a581e12b3012a900bc7bc9057047c9655acb9c6f258096336274e2",
      "text": "大哥哥们瞧不起的偶像之力，\n就好好期待着吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10011_01:1_3_10011_01_j:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8c0a9e4d6aaebeebb0f656ecbec303b592d79826c63dba1c4be902457e33fa0",
      "text": "你、你们既然说到这个份上，我就看看你们有几斤几两。\n待会儿可别哭丧着脸啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
